{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2025-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1761955200, "end_date": 1762559999, "month_true_total": 121, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:04:30 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "208645597", "author": {"steamid": "76561199481088753", "personaname": "ZStar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199481088753/", "num_games_owned": 42, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 204, "last_played": 1777576649, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes get this", "timestamp_created": 1762535823, "timestamp_updated": 1762535823, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208642926", "author": {"steamid": "76561198022251680", "personaname": "bidji", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/monsieur_sabidji/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 4712, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2616, "last_played": 1763370150, "avatar": "864d2bf6b82772fd37ae29a547f99dab3c65eb9e"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Invasion multiplayer mode is fun, let's you ruin other people's single player games. And by ruin, I mean enhance by adding me as an hostile NPC. Or you. Or anyone, really. Also it has graphics. The game does.", "timestamp_created": 1762533650, "timestamp_updated": 1762533650, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208616697", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040688010", "personaname": "LIQUID.MASTURBAMAN.KIMOCHI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/itsajstyles/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 1457, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1457, "last_played": 1762505636, "avatar": "5a46ecf7f287999830b7f4438bc50d33a97d163f"}, "language": "english", "review": "it's actually an okay game\r\n\r\nhaving a spin-off where you play as Harry Hawker instead of karl Fairburne, worth to buy during sale", "timestamp_created": 1762505924, "timestamp_updated": 1762505924, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515625", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208571211", "author": {"steamid": "76561199408430900", "personaname": "acg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199408430900/", "num_games_owned": 16, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 92766, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3137, "playtime_at_review": 48670, "last_played": 1791467216, "avatar": "b9c4a2d558db1a01a83b31b2302329f836f17ec9"}, "language": "english", "review": "For multiplayer: too many bugs, too many failed or refused connections, too many, many, many players cheating. If you leave a lobby and look for another one, it only lets you enter the one you left (5-10 times in a row)!!!! Unbelievable.... And last but not least, in many lobbies, 1-2 seconds of lag, unacceptable in shooter", "timestamp_created": 1762452588, "timestamp_updated": 1762452588, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208558635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051164033", "personaname": "Ben ^_^", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/threeohfour/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 2325, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1655, "last_played": 1774528850, "avatar": "c985ad866f3092d9e4ed7fa0c13c6b79c4b5d8d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "A nice, slow paced action game where your willingness to perform thorough reconnaissance is well rewarded, and simple mistakes will result in having to change position very quickly. It's fun setting traps, distracting enemies, timing your shots to be masked and such. I had a great time playing carefully through the campaign.", "timestamp_created": 1762441749, "timestamp_updated": 1762441749, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51754385232925415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "208537765", "author": {"steamid": "76561198434701139", "personaname": "MajorHAC04", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198434701139/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 2017, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2017, "last_played": 1762263524, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gameplay wise it's a copy paste of SE5 but game is really good. Buy it on sale along with its DLCs. Worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1762416513, "timestamp_updated": 1762416513, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208494255", "author": {"steamid": "76561198985464382", "personaname": "PrinceEuther", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198985464382/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 10140, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8092, "last_played": 1767756724, "avatar": "419d2aa75a0f23e16d29ec2b9b492cb26565f492"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gameplay is great! Graphics for 2025 a little lackluster", "timestamp_created": 1762366161, "timestamp_updated": 1762366161, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208374576", "author": {"steamid": "76561199016924182", "personaname": "TIAGOELGOD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TIAGOELGOD/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 410, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 222, "last_played": 1771029396, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1762241880, "timestamp_updated": 1762241880, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208370143", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993405770", "personaname": "Peace2051_on_Utube", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993405770/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2974, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1855, "last_played": 1762743648, "avatar": "aec3fdea380e759a5682bf43f83091911422fe96"}, "language": "english", "review": "Is it just me or is this the best Sniper Elite so far? Usually I don't review games until I have 100 hours under my belt but I just bought some DLC to further explore those missions. Very interesting collection of guns so there's endless ways to play the missions. It's a great value for your entertainment dollars.", "timestamp_created": 1762234452, "timestamp_updated": 1762234452, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208341658", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984728234", "personaname": "Vapors", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197984728234/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 2144, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2144, "last_played": 1762200113, "avatar": "057aed84d9ac4a593d9c7a398ce3953b1ba91249"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would recommend resistance to be played but I will say I was a bit disappointed in it.  It lacked the \"surprises\" in the main game and become very much rinse and repeat from mission to mission.  Also, they made it so that it was very difficult to upgrade your weapons because the damned workbenches were a ♥♥♥♥♥ to find - even after playing a scenario multiple times.  I always found it laughable for the game to tell you that you are going on the most dangerous mission ever - but we cant afford to outfit you properly.", "timestamp_created": 1762200518, "timestamp_updated": 1762200518, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}